   "CLANNAD: 2,052 dialogue lines of a PS Vita playthrough (Vita3K), references read by Claude, Lens's cached readings of the same crops; Lens reads more lines exactly (96.5% vs 87.4% for Normal).",
   "vita-test, psp-test: 153 and 183 hand-checked dialogue lines of 16 and 14 games (VNDB screenshots), the same crops for all. * Lens also reads the furigana the references leave out: 116 of its 227 psp-test errors, names included.",
   "Dialogue: lines without a speaker name. VOCR5: int8, plain-C runtime, greedy decoding; trained with the owner's captures, incl. planetarian, a Key / Prototype port like CLANNAD's. Time: an estimate for a 3-line box on one Cortex-A9 core at 444 MHz; VOCR5 has not run on a console yet."
